[%# Allow-list (Comserv::Util::AI::EvalAllowList::%ALLOW) — the only config Apply may change. %]
<div class="card" style="margin:16px 0;">
  <div class="card-header">Allow-listed config changes (Apply may only touch these)</div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Target</th><th>Allowed values</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      [% FOREACH a IN allow_list %]
        <tr><td><code>[% a.target | html %]</code></td><td>[% a.allowed | html %]</td><td>[% a.help | html %]</td></tr>
      [% END %]
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="doc-muted">Files live in <code>root/config/</code>; writes are atomic (temp file + rename) and logged, and Revert restores the exact before-value.
      Model/provider routing has no config file today (it is Perl code in <code>Util/ModelCatalog.pm</code> / <code>Model/AI2/Router.pm</code>),
      so routing proposals are <em>code</em> and become todos. OpenRouter soft caps are not stored in app config.</p>
  </div>
</div>
